+under CPU starvation or an indefinitely blocked source decoder. Opening still reads compressed bytes, probes the container and validates the
+first codec frame on the VM thread. Unknown container durations stay unknown
+until EOF. Seek/discard and a blocked source decoder can still delay the
+producer; this does not establish a hard real-time guarantee.
 
