+## 7. Output clock and current limits
+
+The live composition root shares only the mixer with its dedicated PCM
+producer. Rendering advances channels by produced samples independently of
+VM frames. Compressed traversal spans retain loop-label crossings until the
+VM drains a detached lazy event iterator. No TJS callback runs on that worker.
+Headless tests retain their explicitly advanced frame clock and cap.
